# Data is local by default 
data/*
# ...except what the weekly iNaturalist job needs and updates:
!data/ecoregions.geojson
!data/species-info.json
!data/observations-inat.json
!data/inat/
!data/plant-lists.json
!data/postal-fsa.json
!data/observations-sg.json
!data/species-info-overrides.json
# ...but in data/inat/ only state.json (when the last pull ran). The iNaturalist cache and an
# unfinished full pull live in the GitHub Actions cache instead, so they don't bloat the repo.
data/inat/*
!data/inat/state.json

Occurrence_data-subset.numbers
.DS_Store
*.tmp
__pycache__/